# Prettier formats src/, tools/, and the config files. Nothing else.

node_modules/
dist/
.astro/

# The archive is frozen. A formatter run over recipes/ would reflow the ingredient
# tables and rewrite history that a poured batch is supposed to keep verbatim, so all
# Markdown is off limits — docs/ and the READMEs too, since CLAUDE.md's "do not manually
# hard-wrap prose" convention is not something Prettier knows how to respect.
*.md

# TOML is hand-commented data with load-bearing layout (the SAP table's leading array
# has a comment explaining why it sits above the first [table] header). Leave it alone.
*.toml
